OL,3,GNEWSAHow Microsoft outage is affecting
OL,4,ASouth East NHS trusts, councils and
OL,5,Apolice
OL,6,
OL,7,FNHS trusts, councils and police in the
OL,8,Fsouth-east England have been affected
OL,9,Fby the global Microsoft outage.
OL,11,FMicrosoft 365 Services, including
OL,12,FTeams, Outlook and Microsoft's
OL,13,Fartificial intelligence software
OL,14,FCopilot, were hit by "connectivity
OL,15,Fproblems", the company says.
OL,17,FOn Friday morning, most NHS trusts
OL,18,Facross Surrey, East and West Sussex,
OL,19,Fand Kent reported issues receiving and
OL,20,Fsending emails, while some said patient
OL,21,Finquiries and referral correspondences
OL,22,Fwere also affected.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
